# Daggerfall reference

When choosing how the world looks, follow Daggerfall. Distance is a sky-colored haze, not a second model of the whole island. Streets and the town you are standing in stay clear. The next town stays hidden until you walk there.

Keep view-distance changes player-wide. They are not a Southwest-only experiment.
